{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いよいよ明日からアンダーライブがスタートします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日の夜くらいから緊張で寝れなくて笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でも本番が始まったら、きっと楽しくてあっという間に終わっちゃうんだろうな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しい時間 一緒に過ごそうね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://www.nogizaka46.com/s/n46/page/underlive"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全員で良いものを届けられるように、\n本気でリハーサルに挑んできました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今私たちができる全てをお届けします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非遊びに来てくださったら嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶対後悔させません！会場で待ってます☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "学校やお仕事で ライブ来るの難しいよ〜って方は配信チケットもあります👀\n是非見届けてください✉️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobcCIZIk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハ終わりに 色々なこと考えながらお散歩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして明日17日発売の日刊スポーツ芸能面連載「坂道の火曜日」に掲載していただいてます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アンダーライブについての意気込みや思いを沢山お話させて頂きました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非お手に取っていただけたら嬉しいです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobB7nJil.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "くるみちゃん〜‎🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは！明日から3日間 楽しもうね☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202603/mobRxhtLz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、明日お誕生日だね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の一曲 愛って羨ましい / 乃木坂46"}], "source": "official"}